<title>SWITZERLAND: Crossair 1996 net profit jumps 32 percent.</title>
<headline>Crossair 1996 net profit jumps 32 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     23.009	    vs 17.461</p>
<p> Ordinary profit		81.485	    vs 63.180</p>
<p> Depreciation		   58.476	    vs 42.119</p>
<p> Total revenue		  738.3	     vs 464.8</p>
<p> Dividend (percent)	   6.0		 vs 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the regional airline is Crossair AG. Crossair is 70.9 percent owned by SAirGroup.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
